0..76 Comment "// The obligation `include` creates (#738): the included theory\'s rules join"
77..154 Comment "// the including block\'s, and the union is completed as one block. Each block"
155..230 Comment "// below completes alone; the union leaves a critical pair whose two normal"
231..301 Comment "// forms are one call with its arguments swapped, which the path order"
302..368 Comment "// orients neither way, so the including block is refused by name."
370..411 Comment "/// Choosing is combining, left to right."
